           MOVE SQLCODE                         TO DB2-RETURN-CDE
           IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 EQUAL SPACES
              IF ( MAE-FEULIQ < DPR-FECHALT)
                 AND (DPR-FECHALT < MAE-FEPROLIQ)
                    MOVE 'UGE0939'              TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                    MOVE 'NO PERMITE PAGO POR ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                    MOVE 'RENOVACION NETCASH  ' TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
