           EXEC CICS
               LINK PROGRAM ('BG2CMIR0')
               COMMAREA     (BGECMIR)
           END-EXEC.

           IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE 'ERROR LINK BG2CMIR0'      TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 999999-ABEND-CICS
