                      MOVE MIR-COD-ERROR-DEV     TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(6:)
                     PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                     PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                 END-IF
                 SET NO-ABONO-MIR-ABO         TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.
