           MOVE CAA-USERID               TO R632-BANUSULT
           MOVE CAA-NETNAME              TO R632-BANTRULT
           MOVE 'S'                      TO R632-BAINDTOT
           MOVE CAA-ENTIDAD              TO R632-ENTIDAD
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-CONT2          TO R632-FECHA-C2
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER2          TO R632-FECHA-O2
           MOVE CAA-USERID               TO R632-USERID
           MOVE CAA-TERMINAL             TO R632-TERMINAL
           MOVE CAA-CENTRO-CONT          TO R632-CENTRO-C
