      *COL12-F
           MOVE CTE-CANAL-TF               TO MCH-CANAL
           MOVE WS-FECHA-CAMARA            TO MCH-FECHA-OPER
                                              MCH-FECHA-CONT
           MOVE '0100'                     TO MCH-TIPO-MOV
           MOVE WS-IMPORTE-PAG(WS-IND)     TO MCH-IMP-CAPITAL
           MOVE 'UG'                       TO MCH-APLIC-DESTINO
           MOVE WS-CCC                     TO MCH-CTA-DESTINO
           MOVE 'CH'                       TO MCH-IND-TIPO-PAGO
           MOVE WS-TIPO                    TO MCH-CODIDENT
           MOVE WS-NUMERO                  TO MCH-CLAIDENT
           MOVE WS-DIGITO                  TO MCH-DIGIDENT
