      *      ESCRITURA DE LA COLA TS +DC1XXXX (XXXX = EIBTRMID).       *
      *      (SOLO EXISTE UNA COLA TS)                                 *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       777777-WRITEQ.
      *
            ADD +8                             TO WS-LONG-TS
            EXEC CICS
                 WRITEQ TS QUEUE(WS-TS)
                 FROM(W-CONTENIDO-TS)
                 LENGTH(WS-LONG-TS)
                 MAIN NOHANDLE
            END-EXEC

            IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL)
               PERFORM 999999-ABEND-CICS
            END-IF
      *
            MOVE '+DC1'              TO CAA-DESTINO(1)
      *-- IMPRESION A PANTALLA
      *@COL12-I
      *     MOVE 'P'                 TO CAA-IND-PANDOC(1)
      *@COL12-F
      *-- FORMATO DE IMPRESION MAS PEQUE|O
            MOVE '2'                 TO CAA-NUM-DOCUM(1)
      *-- SE SUBE EL INICIO DE LA IMPRESION
      *@COL12-I
      *     MOVE '02'                TO CAA-PRILIN-DOCUM(1).
            MOVE '00'                TO CAA-PRILIN-DOCUM(1).
      *@COL12-F

      ******************************************************************
      *              7778-DELETEQ                                      |
      *._______________________________________________________________.
      *|    BORRAMOS LA POSIBLE COLA QUE PUDIERA EXISTIR               |
      *|    - SALIDA A PANTALLA (+DC1)                                 |
      *|_______________________________________________________________|
      *
      ******************************************************************
       7778-DELETEQ.
      *
           IF CAA-COD-ERROR NOT EQUAL SPACES AND LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '+DC1'                   TO WS-PREFIJO-TS
              MOVE CAA-TERMINAL             TO WS-SUFIJO-TS
              PERFORM 6666-BORRAR-TS
      * PARA CONTABILIDAD...BORRAR COLA: +TOT
              MOVE '+TOT'                   TO WS-PREFIJO-TS
              MOVE CAA-TERMINAL             TO WS-SUFIJO-TS
              PERFORM 6666-BORRAR-TS
      *COL36-I
              PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
      *COL36-F
           END-IF.

      *

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                       6666-BORRAR-TS                           *
      *  - SE BORRA LA POSIBLE COLA TS +DC1XXXX QUE PUDIESE EXISTIR    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       6666-BORRAR-TS.
      *
           EXEC CICS
                DELETEQ TS
                QUEUE(WS-TS)
                NOHANDLE
           END-EXEC

           EVALUATE EIBRESP
                WHEN (DFHRESP(NORMAL))
                     CONTINUE
                WHEN (DFHRESP(QIDERR))
                     CONTINUE
                WHEN OTHER
                     MOVE 'BORRAR TS'         TO ABC-REFERENCIA
                     PERFORM 999999-ABEND-CICS
           END-EVALUATE.
