      *
      *COL06I
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2124-VALIDAR-IMPT37
      *SE VALIDA EL VALOR DIGITADO EN LA TABLA UGDTT37 PARA SABER EL
      *VALOR A COMPARAR CONTRA UH570-VALOR PARA SABER SI SE LANZA O NO
      *LA AUTORIZACION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2124-VALIDAR-IMPT37.
             INITIALIZE                              UGTCT37
             MOVE 'VALOR BASE'                     TO T37-ELEMENTO
             MOVE '2070'                           TO T37-SECCION
             EXEC SQL
                SELECT RESTO
                INTO :T37-RESTO
                FROM
                UGDTT37
                WHERE ELEMENTO = :T37-ELEMENTO
                AND   SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
             END-EXEC

             MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

             IF DB2-OK AND SQLWARN0 = SPACES

                SET SW-SI-FACULT        TO TRUE
             ELSE
                IF DB2-NOTFND
                   SET SW-NO-FACULT     TO TRUE
                ELSE
                   MOVE 'UGE0939'            TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                   MOVE 'EXR SELECT UGDTT37' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                   MOVE 'SQLCODE '           TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:8)
                   MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(9:)
      *@COL12A-I
                   PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
      *@COL12A-F
                   PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
                END-IF
             END-IF.
      ******************************************************************
      *              VALIDA-FACULTADES                                 *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
