           INITIALIZE  QGEC0010-AREA
                       QCECAUTF
                       CAA-COD-AVISO1
                       CAA-COD-AVISO2
                       CAA-COD-ERROR
                       CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                       CAA-VAR2-ERROR
      *
           MOVE CAA-CODTRAN                   TO QGEC0010-CODITRAN
           MOVE 'UG '                         TO QGEC0010-CODAPLIC
           MOVE WS-CODFUN                     TO QGEC0010-CLVFUNC
                                                 AUTF-CLVFUNC
           MOVE CAA-USERID                    TO QGEC0010-CODUSU
           MOVE CAA-FECHA-OPER                TO QGEC0010-FECHA
           MOVE CAA-ENTIDAD                   TO QGEC0010-ENTIDAD
           MOVE CAA-CENTRO-CONT               TO QGEC0010-CEOPER
           MOVE SPACES                        TO QGEC0010-SUBCLV
