               EVALUATE DB2-OK
                   WHEN TRUE
                       CONTINUE
                   WHEN OTHER
                       MOVE 'UGE0939'              TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                       MOVE 'ERX INSERT UGDTLOG  ' TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                       MOVE 'SQLCODE '       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(1:8)
                       MOVE DB2-RETURN-CDE   TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(9:)
                       PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                       PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
               END-EVALUATE.
            .
