                 MOVE 'ERROR EN UR9CRUNT'   TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                 MOVE RUNTERR-SQLCODE       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                 MOVE RUNTERR-SQLERRM       TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR(10:)
                 PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                 PERFORM 999999-ABEND-DB2
                 PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              ELSE
                 MOVE RUNTERR-COD-ERROR     TO CAA-COD-ERROR
                 MOVE 'ERROR EN UR9CRUNT'   TO CAA-VAR1-ERROR
                 MOVE RUNTERR-VAR1-ERROR    TO CAA-VAR2-ERROR
                 PERFORM 999999-ROLLBACK
                 PERFORM 3-FINAL-PROGRAMA
