                 MOVE WS-IMPORTE-PAGO       TO LOG-IMPANT
                 MOVE 'UR2PC11'             TO LOG-TABLA
                 MOVE 'PAGO GASTOS'         TO LOG-DESCRIPCION
                 PERFORM 9-REGISTRA-LOG
